quotes":[{"c":"FIG 2025 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2025-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"For example, you should expect to see significant investments in our AI efforts because we believe AI will be critical to how software development workflows evolve moving forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/04/figma-fig-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2025-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"…here to invest in some of these newer areas that we've been exploring both as we deepen our investments in AI with products like Figma Make in particular, and spend on the inference side as we evolve our sales and marketing presences, and strategies there as we seek to, you know, take off…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/04/figma-fig-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2025-09-03","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"Now you may have seen other AI vibe coding tools like this, and perhaps you're wondering what makes Figma Make different?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/04/figma-fig-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2025-09-03","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"There are a ton of other tools that are sort of in this vibe coding, vibe designing, vibe whatever you want to call it, area.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/04/figma-fig-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"We are building our platform to meet these changing needs, and it is driving our momentum in a few key ways: product velocity, platform strategy, and AI investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"We will continue investing heavily in AI, and we will trade near-term margin to build the right long-term platform for our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"Given the strength across our business, we are raising our outlook both on revenue and operating income for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Praveer Malwani","x":"All of that is honestly giving us confidence in being able to raise our outlook and guidance for Q4 and the rest of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"During a period where some vibe coding tools are reportedly slowing growth, Figma Make is speeding up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Eric","x":"Dylan, you mentioned in the prepared remarks that as some of the vibe coders are slowing, Make is growing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q4","e":"fig","d":"2026-02-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"As we previewed last quarter, adjusted free cash flow declined sequentially in Q4 driven by continued investment in infrastructure, and AI, changes in the timing of vendor payments, and a one time $25,000,000 IP transfer tax payment related to our acquisition of Weavie.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/figma-fig-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q4","e":"fig","d":"2026-02-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"We are investing deeply in the business to define new AI native workflows and better support our customers as they adapt to new ways of working.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/figma-fig-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2025 Q4","e":"fig","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Weiss","x":"And then for Previr, on the price increase, I'm getting a lot of questions from investors in terms of understand mid single digit impact for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/figma-fig-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q1","e":"fig","d":"2026-05-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"One of the world's largest professional services firms expanded their Figma investment after a company-wide Figma AI training drove a step change in adoption and embedded AI capabilities at the center of how they design, prototype and deliver client work across every major industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/15/figma-fig-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q1","e":"fig","d":"2026-05-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"I think there are many aspects around delivering and playing for the big prizes when it comes to these new markets around AI where short-term thinking might create spend, but it's only -- you only engage in that if you believe in the long-term TAM and profile of the business that you're entering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/15/figma-fig-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q1","e":"fig","d":"2026-05-14","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"So I think as where we stand, we're ahead of our expectations, and it's giving us confidence in the raise -- in our ability to raise our guide for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/15/figma-fig-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q1","e":"fig","d":"2026-05-14","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"In their words, they can only \"get to a level of detail that we want in Figma, that's not possible with vibe coding.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/15/figma-fig-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q1","e":"fig","d":"2026-05-14","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"Our outperformance in NDR was driven by strength in seat expansion and growth in our non-seat-based offerings, including AI add-ons.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/15/figma-fig-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"A technology infrastructure company expanded its AI credit add-ons multiple times within a single quarter, increasing its purchase credit commitment by 5x from its first add-on as part of a company-wide push for AI native workflows across its product development org.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/figma-fig-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"And then as we make those transitions, similar to the investment trajectory that we've taken with our AI products thus far, we'll observe our ability to monetize them on the other side before fully incorporating them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/figma-fig-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"For the full year, we are raising our outlook to $1.463 billion to $1.467 billion, implying 39% growth at the midpoint, a raise of $40 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/figma-fig-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q2","e":"fig","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Aleksandr Zukin","x":"Dylan, given the amount of products out there right now in the marketplace from cloud design to Vercel to the vibe coding platforms, maybe just level set and remind us what are you seeing on both top of funnel and upsell dynamics and cross-sell?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/figma-fig-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"Last quarter, we highlighted a technology infrastructure company that was rapidly expanding its use of our AI products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"Over the last 6 months, the company increased its AI add-ons twice before signing a new drawdown agreement, bringing its AI credit spend commitment to over 7x its initial purchase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dylan Field","x":"And start to pass it on to our users on the cost side, overall, will set us up with the best possible way going forward too.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/figma-fig-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FIG 2026 Q3","e":"fig","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Praveer Melwani","x":"We have also continued to drive efficiency in how our team operates more broadly, resulting in cost savings in the quarter.","url":"ht